{"schema":"asx.scenario.v2","id":"mpsc-recv-many-001","description":"recv_many (Rust mpsc.rs:1754, poll :1867; bd-9kll.5.7): a batch takes up to limit queued messages oldest first ([1,2], then [3]); limit 0 gives [] at once; an empty open channel parks the receiver until a commit, and the woken batch takes everything queued by then ([4,5]); once the last sender is gone the batch is [] with ASX_OK, not an error. A second receiver blocked in recv_many is cancelled by the driver: ASX_E_CANCELLED with the trace \"mpsc::recv_many cancelled\".","unit":"mpsc","rules":["inv.determinism.replayable","rule.cancel.request"],"seed":42,"lab":{"max_steps":1000},"regions":[{"name":"r.main","parent":"root","budget":null}],"channels":[{"name":"ch","type":"mpsc","capacity":4,"sender":"t.p","receiver":"t.r"},{"name":"ch.c","type":"mpsc","capacity":1,"sender":"t.p","receiver":"t.c"}],"sync":[],"tasks":[{"name":"t.p","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"try_send","channel":"ch","value":1},{"op":"try_send","channel":"ch","value":2},{"op":"try_send","channel":"ch","value":3},{"op":"sleep","ns":100},{"op":"try_send","channel":"ch","value":4},{"op":"try_send","channel":"ch","value":5},{"op":"sleep","ns":100},{"op":"close_sender","channel":"ch"},{"op":"trace","message":"producer done"}]},{"name":"t.r","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"recv_many","channel":"ch","limit":2},{"op":"recv_many","channel":"ch","limit":0},{"op":"recv_many","channel":"ch","limit":8},{"op":"recv_many","channel":"ch","limit":8},{"op":"recv_many","channel":"ch","limit":8},{"op":"trace","message":"receiver done"}]},{"name":"t.c","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"recv_many","channel":"ch.c","limit":4}]}],"script":[{"at_ns":10,"op":{"op":"cancel_task","task":"t.c","kind":"User"}}],"expect":{"kind":"ok"}}
